|[[File:Chlodnik (Cold Borscht).jpg|123px]]
|[[Slavs|Slav]] and [[Baltic Sea|Baltic]] nations
| Made from beetroot with optional onions, garlic, carrot, celery parsnip etc; with a base of sour cream, buttermilk, kefir, kvass, or yogurt. May be served with boiled potato or egg. National varieties include  ''svekolnik'', ''kholodnik'', ''šaltibarščiai''.
